id.instance: String (TS "c<n>") (read off views as JSON strings)
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32 (not used in this chunk)
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value> (not used in this chunk)
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (the tests expect() every store and registry call, and catch create_game's panic where TS caught its throw)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if (an absent key is asserted with Value::get(..).is_none())
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all (every frame, view, row and clock snapshot is read as TS's JSON)
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators (not used in this chunk)
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back (not used in this chunk)
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box (the clock's on_expire is an Arc<dyn Fn(ClockExpiry) + Send + Sync>)
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state (real-catalog tests call jackioh_cards::register_all(); scripted ones the testkit's thread-local override via support::engine)
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates; #[tokio::test(start_paused = true)] for every clock and actor test, real time for the listener tests
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only (the tests record events by their `event` field with a thread-local tracing layer)
time.source: actor::clock::now_ms() follows tokio's paused clock; advance(ms) is tokio::time::sleep plus yields
actor.api: MatchActor::attach sync; idle, snapshot, view_for, engine_state, clocks, submit, stop async; Registry::actor_for(&Arc<App>, &str)
socket.fake: support::socket::create_fake_socket() -> FakeSocket { socket(), sent(), receive(), drop(), clear(), is_open() }
engine.fake: support::engine::{create_fake_engine(), fake_deck(&[&str])}; the scripted cards cost 1
store.tx: one TS store call = begin(None) + method + commit
